body:
With the current implementation, it is not possible for us to provide such a feature. That being said, the combination of multiple sorts inside a single compare function is doable:

```js
const compare = function(a, b) {
  if (a.property1 < b.property1) return 1;
  if (a.property1 > b.property1) return -1;
  // property1 is equal for both
  if (a.property2 < b.property2) return 1;
  if (a.property2 > b.property2) return -1;
  // property2 is equal for both
  // ... and so on.

  return 0;
}
```
